  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 3.5.0: Code Quality Improvements & Architecture Refactoring (MINOR Release - 2025-12-27)\n\nIMPROVEMENTS:\n- Code Quality: Comprehensive refactoring across services, providers, and interfaces for better SOLID/DRY compliance\n- Interface Consistency: Renamed ISQLQueryGenerator to ISqlQueryGenerator for naming consistency\n- Code Duplication Elimination: Removed unnecessary wrapper methods and orchestration services\n- Architecture: Improved service layer organization and separation of concerns\n- PDF Parsing: Enhanced PDF parsing and OCR robustness\n- Search Strategy: Improved search strategy implementation and code quality\n\nADDED:\n- QueryIntentAnalysisResult Model: New model for query intent classification results\n- SearchOptions Enhancements: Added factory methods and Clone method to SearchOptions\n- QueryStrategyRequest Consolidation: Unified query strategy request DTOs into single QueryStrategyRequest model\n\nCHANGED:\n- Interface Method Signatures: Removed preferredLanguage parameter from interfaces and consolidated method overloads\n- Interface Naming: ISQLQueryGenerator renamed to ISqlQueryGenerator (breaking change for direct interface users)\n- Service Organization: Removed unused ISourceSelectionService and SourceSelectionService\n\nREMOVED:\n- Unused Services: Removed ISourceSelectionService and SourceSelectionService\n- Unnecessary Wrappers: Removed unnecessary wrapper methods and orchestration services\n\nCODE QUALITY:\n- Maintained 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- Improved SOLID/DRY compliance across codebase\n- Enhanced maintainability and readability\n- Better separation of concerns\n\nThis release focuses on code quality improvements and architecture refactoring. Interface naming changes may require updates if directly using ISQLQueryGenerator interface.",
